#### Requirements

Audit Log records script/admin-level changes:

- Insert.
- Update.
- Archive/delete.
- Review Queue approval.
- CC payment match/unmatch.
- Reconciliation fix.
- Retry partial write.
- Admin command.

Target schema:

```text
